    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Nothing that moves can be stopped — and movement, for you, is what makes you real.</em></p><p><strong>Mode:</strong> Unstoppable Force / <strong>drift:</strong> Toward.</p><p>You bank Surge when you arrive, not when you start. When you move at least half your speed in a turn and land a Violence strike that same turn, bank <strong>+1 Surge</strong>. Once per turn. This is on top of the class's eat-the-blow Surge; your cap is the ordinary one.</p>",
